{
  "fps": 30,
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "rate": "+5%",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "life",
      "from": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 629,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "你有没有过这样的经历？",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 3133,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/life-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 70
        },
        {
          "text": "刚开始做一件事，哪哪都不顺。",
          "startMs": 3367,
          "endMs": 6667,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/life-02.mp3",
          "from": 101,
          "durationInFrames": 99
        },
        {
          "text": "好不容易顺起来了，又担心：会不会出什么岔子？",
          "startMs": 6900,
          "endMs": 11667,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/life-03.mp3",
          "from": 207,
          "durationInFrames": 143
        },
        {
          "text": "工作、过日子、带孩子，我们每天都在面对变化。",
          "startMs": 11900,
          "endMs": 16567,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/life-04.mp3",
          "from": 357,
          "durationInFrames": 140
        },
        {
          "text": "几千年前的人，也在琢磨这些事。",
          "startMs": 16800,
          "endMs": 20067,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/life-05.mp3",
          "from": 504,
          "durationInFrames": 98
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lines",
      "from": 629,
      "durationInFrames": 583,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "说到易经，很多人先想到那些看不懂的横杠。",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 4833,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/lines-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 121
        },
        {
          "text": "咱们先认两个样子。",
          "startMs": 5067,
          "endMs": 7133,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/lines-02.mp3",
          "from": 152,
          "durationInFrames": 62
        },
        {
          "text": "一根完整的，叫阳爻。",
          "startMs": 7367,
          "endMs": 10433,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/lines-03.mp3",
          "from": 221,
          "durationInFrames": 92
        },
        {
          "text": "一根中间断开的，叫阴爻。",
          "startMs": 10667,
          "endMs": 13933,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/lines-04.mp3",
          "from": 320,
          "durationInFrames": 98
        },
        {
          "text": "爻，你先把它理解成组成卦象的一笔。",
          "startMs": 14167,
          "endMs": 18533,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/lines-05.mp3",
          "from": 425,
          "durationInFrames": 131
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "from": 1212,
      "durationInFrames": 820,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "把这样的笔画一层层叠起来，就能组成不同图样。",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 5633,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/build-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 145
        },
        {
          "text": "三层的，有八种，叫八卦。",
          "startMs": 5867,
          "endMs": 9400,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/build-02.mp3",
          "from": 176,
          "durationInFrames": 106
        },
        {
          "text": "两组三层的再上下叠起来，就成了六层的卦。",
          "startMs": 9633,
          "endMs": 14267,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/build-03.mp3",
          "from": 289,
          "durationInFrames": 139
        },
        {
          "text": "把不同样子都摆出来，一共有六十四种。",
          "startMs": 14500,
          "endMs": 18100,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/build-04.mp3",
          "from": 435,
          "durationInFrames": 108
        },
        {
          "text": "这就是六十四卦的基本结构。",
          "startMs": 18333,
          "endMs": 21333,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/build-05.mp3",
          "from": 550,
          "durationInFrames": 90
        },
        {
          "text": "至于这些符号在历史上怎样形成，是另一个故事。",
          "startMs": 21567,
          "endMs": 26433,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/build-06.mp3",
          "from": 647,
          "durationInFrames": 146
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stories",
      "from": 2032,
      "durationInFrames": 519,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "可光有图样，怎么讲事情呢？",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 4133,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/stories-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 100
        },
        {
          "text": "易经给不同的卦配上名字和文字，谈处境，也谈行动。",
          "startMs": 4367,
          "endMs": 9633,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/stories-02.mp3",
          "from": 131,
          "durationInFrames": 158
        },
        {
          "text": "咱们借几件今天的小事，体会一下。",
          "startMs": 9867,
          "endMs": 13033,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/stories-03.mp3",
          "from": 296,
          "durationInFrames": 95
        },
        {
          "text": "这些是帮助理解的生活比方。",
          "startMs": 13267,
          "endMs": 16400,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/stories-04.mp3",
          "from": 398,
          "durationInFrames": 94
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cooking",
      "from": 2551,
      "durationInFrames": 728,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "第一次学做饭，火大了，菜糊了，盐还放多了。",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 5533,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/cooking-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 142
        },
        {
          "text": "这时候，你会不会想：我是不是就不适合？",
          "startMs": 5767,
          "endMs": 10300,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/cooking-02.mp3",
          "from": 173,
          "durationInFrames": 136
        },
        {
          "text": "屯卦，谈到事情初生时的艰难。",
          "startMs": 10533,
          "endMs": 14133,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/cooking-03.mp3",
          "from": 316,
          "durationInFrames": 108
        },
        {
          "text": "借这个意思看学做饭：先把一步学会，再接着学下一步。",
          "startMs": 14367,
          "endMs": 19567,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/cooking-04.mp3",
          "from": 431,
          "durationInFrames": 156
        },
        {
          "text": "一次做砸，不必急着给自己下结论。",
          "startMs": 19800,
          "endMs": 23367,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/cooking-05.mp3",
          "from": 594,
          "durationInFrames": 107
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seed",
      "from": 3279,
      "durationInFrames": 669,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "种下一粒种子，第二天没动静，第三天也没动静。",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 5500,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/seed-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 141
        },
        {
          "text": "总不能每天扒开土，问它怎么还不长。",
          "startMs": 5733,
          "endMs": 9533,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/seed-02.mp3",
          "from": 172,
          "durationInFrames": 114
        },
        {
          "text": "需卦里，有等待的意思。",
          "startMs": 9767,
          "endMs": 12700,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/seed-03.mp3",
          "from": 293,
          "durationInFrames": 88
        },
        {
          "text": "该等的时候，照样能浇水、照料，把能做的先做好。",
          "startMs": 12933,
          "endMs": 18167,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/seed-04.mp3",
          "from": 388,
          "durationInFrames": 157
        },
        {
          "text": "有些进展，暂时还看不见。",
          "startMs": 18400,
          "endMs": 21400,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/seed-05.mp3",
          "from": 552,
          "durationInFrames": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "learning",
      "from": 3948,
      "durationInFrames": 708,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "后来，饭做得熟练了，别人一夸，就觉得自己什么都会了。",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 6167,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/learning-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 161
        },
        {
          "text": "可换一道新菜，照样可能翻车。",
          "startMs": 6400,
          "endMs": 9600,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/learning-02.mp3",
          "from": 192,
          "durationInFrames": 96
        },
        {
          "text": "谦卦，让人想到谦逊和分寸。",
          "startMs": 9833,
          "endMs": 13267,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/learning-03.mp3",
          "from": 295,
          "durationInFrames": 103
        },
        {
          "text": "会做的，认真做；不会的，接着学。",
          "startMs": 13500,
          "endMs": 17900,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/learning-04.mp3",
          "from": 405,
          "durationInFrames": 132
        },
        {
          "text": "给别人留一点说话的地方，也给自己留一点进步的空间。",
          "startMs": 18133,
          "endMs": 22700,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/learning-05.mp3",
          "from": 544,
          "durationInFrames": 137
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "from": 4656,
      "durationInFrames": 801,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "六十四卦里，当然还有更多内容。",
          "startMs": 800,
          "endMs": 4200,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-01.mp3",
          "from": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 102
        },
        {
          "text": "今天，我们先认识了它的样子，也借三个生活片段，摸到一点门道。",
          "startMs": 4433,
          "endMs": 10200,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-02.mp3",
          "from": 133,
          "durationInFrames": 173
        },
        {
          "text": "下次遇到变化，可以先问问自己。",
          "startMs": 10433,
          "endMs": 13933,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-03.mp3",
          "from": 313,
          "durationInFrames": 105
        },
        {
          "text": "我现在是什么处境？",
          "startMs": 14167,
          "endMs": 16300,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-04.mp3",
          "from": 425,
          "durationInFrames": 64
        },
        {
          "text": "有什么值得留心？",
          "startMs": 16533,
          "endMs": 18600,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-05.mp3",
          "from": 496,
          "durationInFrames": 62
        },
        {
          "text": "下一步，能做点什么？",
          "startMs": 18833,
          "endMs": 21667,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-06.mp3",
          "from": 565,
          "durationInFrames": 85
        },
        {
          "text": "先把眼前的日子，看清一点。",
          "startMs": 21900,
          "endMs": 24967,
          "timestampMs": null,
          "confidence": null,
          "audio": "audio/iching-life/ending-07.mp3",
          "from": 657,
          "durationInFrames": 92
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
